--
-- REVIEW THESE 30 ITEMS — some are the source ledger's own flagged
-- ambiguities (balance conflicts, unclear names), others are judgment calls
-- I made matching the boarding list against the day register by name
-- similarity. High-confidence matches (>=0.90 similarity, e.g. spelling
-- variants like "Asiimwe Brendah"/"Asiimwe Brenda") were applied directly.
-- Medium-confidence matches (e.g. "Mpindi Ruth" -> day-list's "Maindi Ruth",
-- which usefully fills in a day-list record that had NO fee data at all)
